  "description": "Zero-config OpenTelemetry APM for classic ASP.NET (WebForms and MVC 5) on .NET Framework 4.7.2+. Registers its HTTP modules automatically (no web.config edit), traces requests, WebForms page lifecycle stages, outgoing HTTP calls and runtime metrics, and exports via OTLP to Grafana Cloud, Tempo, Prometheus or any OpenTelemetry-compatible backend. Includes a binding-redirect helper script.",
